# On the host, this repo's clone is also its runtime directory, so the paths
# the deploy creates there sit inside the working tree. Ignored so a file
# committed at the same path cannot make git pull refuse there. data/ is
# kept for that reason alone — the database lives at /var/db/chat, off the
# checkout, where git clean cannot reach it.
